WEBVTT

00:20:58.208 --> 00:21:00.601
They report that it enhances
their job performance

00:21:00.625 --> 00:21:02.893
and helps them make
progress toward their goals.

00:21:02.917 --> 00:21:04.309
AR: I have a BetterUp coach.

00:21:04.333 --> 00:21:08.476
She helped me realize that I kind of
have these automatic negative thoughts,

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.268
and now I have developed some skill

00:21:10.292 --> 00:21:11.976
to be like, "OK, hit pause."

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.018
That's an automatic negative thought.

00:21:14.042 --> 00:21:15.601
It may or may not be true.

00:21:15.625 --> 00:21:18.958
Let's evaluate that really
rationally at a different time.

00:21:20.083 --> 00:21:23.518
AG: Alexi doesn't get nauseous
before big meetings anymore.

00:21:23.542 --> 00:21:25.726
He's still working regularly with Heidi

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.268
and with two other coaches.

00:21:27.292 --> 00:21:29.976
AR: Yeah, they're like my pit crew.
They keep me going.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.434
AG: With the help of his coaches,
Alexi has successfully taken his vision